                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG ZUR HANDHABUNG VON DOWNLINK-UPLINK-KOLLISIONEN IN EINEM DRAHTLOSKOMMUNIKATIONSNETZWERK</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET APPAREIL DE GESTION DE COLLISION DE LIAISON MONTANTE DE LIAISON DESCENDANTE DANS UN RÉSEAU DE COMMUNICATION SANS FIL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD AND APPARATUS FOR DOWNLINK UPLINK COLLISION HANDLING IN WIRELESS COMMUNICATION NETWORK</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure relates to a method performed by a terminal in a mobile communication system, the method comprising initiating a deregistration procedure; identifying a collision between the deregistration procedure and a downlink, DL, non-access stratum, NAS, transport procedure initiated by a network entity; identifying contents of a message for the DL NAS transport procedure; and in case that the message for the DL NAS transport procedure includes information indicating that an acknowledgement for a steering of roaming, SOR, transparent container is requested, determining to progress the DL NAS transport procedure and transmitting, to the network entity, an uplink, UL, NAS transport message including the acknowledgement for the SOR transparent container.</p>
            </abstract>
